{
  "declaredLength": 4816,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C00200010000201000000002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kann man denn nicht mal ungestört im Kreise der\nFamilie sein, du <U+0010><U+0004>ᄀÿဓ<U+0000>ungehobelter Bengelungehobeltes Gör?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Jetzt chill mal dein Leben, alter Mann.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650074007A00740020006300680069006C006C0020006D0061006C0020006400650069006E0020004C006500620065006E002C00200061006C0074006500720020004D0061006E006E002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "E-Entschuldigung!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nImmer geht es hier nur um <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...\nAber ich hab auch was zu sagen.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aber davor möchte ich zuerst gegen euch beide\nkämpfen.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410062006500720020006400610076006F00720020006D00F6006300680074006500200069006300680020007A0075006500720073007400200067006500670065006E00200065007500630068002000620065006900640065000A006B00E4006D007000660065006E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Wenn <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> Bock hat, bin ich auch\ndabei.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000570065006E006E0020001000020100000000200042006F0063006B0020006800610074002C002000620069006E002000690063006800200061007500630068000A00640061006200650069002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kämpfen wir!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00E4006D007000660065006E002000770069007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ein andermal.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450069006E00200061006E006400650072006D0061006C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du hast schon so ’ne Tendenz dazu, immer\nerst mal Nein zu sagen, oder?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mit Irokex und den anderen könnte ich vielleicht\ngewinnen...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNein, ich WERDE gewinnen!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich kann’s mit jedem Fanary aufnehmen.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006300680020006B0061006E006E201900730020006D006900740020006A006500640065006D002000460061006E0061007200790020006100750066006E00650068006D0065006E002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wenn du gegen uns kämpfst, stehen dir quasi\nzwei Canarys gegenüber. Top, oder?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Kämpfen wir!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00E4006D007000660065006E002000770069007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Moment noch.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006D0065006E00740020006E006F00630068002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "He, ich dachte, du willst ’nen Fight?\nSo ’ne Chance gibt’s nur ein Mal!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich bin zwar so nett und kämpf gegen euch,\naber den Win hol ich mir trotzdem!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Na, was denn nun?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0061002C0020007700610073002000640065006E006E0020006E0075006E003F00100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wenn wir gewinnen, hilfst du uns dabei,\nCanary-Brot zu machen!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006E006E002000770069007200200067006500770069006E006E0065006E002C002000680069006C00660073007400200064007500200075006E0073002000640061006200650069002C000A00430061006E006100720079002D00420072006F00740020007A00750020006D0061006300680065006E002100100002011400100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Können wir jetzt endlich kämpfen?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004B00F6006E006E0065006E00200077006900720020006A00650074007A007400200065006E0064006C0069006300680020006B00E4006D007000660065006E003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Diesmal mach ich richtig Ernst! Zapplarang,\nMega-entwickle dich zum ultimativen Endgegner!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Los, Stalobor! Vollziehe die Mega-Entwicklung!\nZeigen wir der Jugend, wo’s langgeht!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Irokex! Lass uns zusammen das Maximum aus\ndeiner Mega-Entwicklung rausholen!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wir haben gewonnen...!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570069007200200068006100620065006E0020006700650077006F006E006E0065006E002E002E002E0021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Na dann, spill, Fanary. Was wolltest du?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E0061002000640061006E006E002C0020007300700069006C006C002C002000460061006E006100720079002E002000570061007300200077006F006C006C0074006500730074002000640075003F001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ich würde gerne ein Outfit für dich designen.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006300680020007700FC0072006400650020006700650072006E0065002000650069006E0020004F007500740066006900740020006600FC007200200064006900630068002000640065007300690067006E0065006E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Okay... Mach mal. Wenn mir das Design gefällt,\nzieh ich’s auch an.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006B00610079002E002E002E0020004D0061006300680020006D0061006C002E002000570065006E006E0020006D006900720020006400610073002000440065007300690067006E002000670065006600E4006C006C0074002C000A007A0069006500680020006900630068201900730020006100750063006800200061006E002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dann bin ich auch mit von der Partie!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIch muss mich doch in Canary hineinversetzen\nkönnen, also brauch ich auch so ’nen Fummel.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "VERGISS ES!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560045005200470049005300530020004500530021001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, hier. Schenk ich dir.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C00200068006900650072002E00200053006300680065006E006B00200069006300680020006400690072002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Du erhältst Canarys Outfit!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440075002000650072006800E4006C007400730074002000430061006E00610072007900730020004F0075007400660069007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Und das hier ist für dich. Ein Canary-Brot von\nmeinem Opa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E006400200064006100730020006800690065007200200069007300740020006600FC007200200064006900630068002E002000450069006E002000430061006E006100720079002D00420072006F007400200076006F006E000A006D00650069006E0065006D0020004F00700061002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ein Canary-Brot... Ich werde es mein Leben lang\nin Ehren halten.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450069006E002000430061006E006100720079002D00420072006F0074002E002E002E00200049006300680020007700650072006400650020006500730020006D00650069006E0020004C006500620065006E0020006C0061006E0067000A0069006E00200045006800720065006E002000680061006C00740065006E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bäh! Nee, iss es lieber.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200E4006800210020004E00650065002C00200069007300730020006500730020006C00690065006200650072002E001000020114000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Aber krass, dass ich immer noch nicht gegen dich\ngewinnen kann, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. Und das,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nobwohl<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nZapplarang<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nund<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nich<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nso<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nviel<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ngegrindet<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhaben.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 25,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 162
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Das Canary-Brot ist voll der Renner. Ich überleg\ngerade, ob ich nicht überall hier in der Gegend<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nLäden aufmachen soll!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es ist wichtig zu sagen, was man auf dem Herzen\nhat. Irgendwann schaff ich das auch...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    }
  ],
